\begin_layout Standard
For a given weight 
\begin_inset Formula $n\geq3$
\end_inset

 let 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathscr{L}(n)$
\end_inset

 denote the the number of linearly independent relations of Ihara-Kaneko-Zagier
 derivation relation.
 In 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "doi:10.1142/S1793042117500245,TANAKA20092021"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 the authors have tabulated the values of 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathscr{L}(n)$
\end_inset

 calculated using the Risa/Asir and Mathematica general computer algebra
 system for 
\begin_inset Formula $\ensuremath{n=3}$
\end_inset

 to 
\begin_inset Formula $n=15$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

