\begin_inset Formula $\mathscr{L}(7)=2^{5-{\color{blue}1}}+2^{5-{\color{blue}2}}-2^{5-{\color{blue}5}}-{\color{red}\omega(6)}-1=2^{4}+2^{3}-2^{0}-{\color{red}0}-1=16+8-1-1=\mathbf{22}$
