 the number of linearly independent relations of Ihara-Kaneko-Zagier derivation
 relation can be calculated by the following formula:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathscr{L}(n)=2^{n-2}-1-\omega(n-1)-c(n-2)
\]

\end_inset


\end_layout

