\begin_layout Standard
Furthermore, the next figure illustrates the transform applied to the sequence
 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathbf{a}=\mathbf{p}*\mathbf{pic}=(1,1,2,4,8,16,\dots)$
\end_inset

.
 This particular case is of primary interest as it is directly related to
 Conjecture 1, by virtue of the fact that each value of the sequence 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{P}(\mathbf{a})$
\end_inset

 displayed in the bottom green row is precisely one greater than the correspondi
ng value of 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{L}(n)$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\noindent
